🗳️ RateMyRep — Complete Team Brief & Build Plan
What We're Building
A web app where any Arizona resident enters their zip code and instantly sees whether their state representative actually does what they promise. The hero feature is a Say vs. Do Score — an AI-computed alignment index between a rep's public statements and their actual voting record.
One line pitch:

"Enter your Arizona zip code. Find out if your rep keeps their promises."


The Problem We're Solving
Most people have no idea how their local representative actually votes. Civic transparency tools exist for federal politicians but almost nobody covers state-level reps. Arizona state legislators make decisions that directly affect ASU students — education funding, housing, healthcare — yet most residents couldn't name their rep let alone track their votes.

Target User
Arizona residents — especially first-generation voters, college students, and local activists — who want to hold their rep accountable but don't have time to research voting records themselves.

